</div></div><div id="text_block-10-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-l c-text-light">Booking can be made here for <b>up to 10 people</b>, alternatively just get in touch with us at qtkitchengleniris@gmail.com to organise a QT group experience!<br><br>Please note that for parties of 6 or more, we ask to dine on banquet menus. Credit card details required to authorise your reservation.<br></div><div id="text_block-12-48" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-m c-text-l c-heading-dark"></div><img id="image-14-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/BMW01093-copy.jpg" class="ct-image c-img-max"></div></section></div><footer id="section-242-12" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-243-12" class="ct-div-block c-columns-6 c-columns-l-2 c-columns-gap-l c-margin-bottom-l"><div id="div_block-244-12" class="ct-div-block c-col-span-2 c-margin-right-m"><img id="image-245-12" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/logo_transparent_background.png" class="ct-image c-logo c-margin-bottom-m"><div id="text_block-246-12" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-light">Incredible Vietnamese Fusion Cuisine in Glen Iris.&nbsp; Open from Lunch until late.&nbsp; Renown for bold flavours and hearty service from hospitality veterans.</div></div><div id="div_block-254-12" class="ct-div-block "><div id="text_block-255-12" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-light">Who Are We</div><a id="link_text-256-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/about-us">About Us</a><a id="link_text-257-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/functions-in-glen-iris">Functions</a><a id="link_text-258-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a><a id="link_text-259-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/lunch-menu">Brunch &amp; Lunch in Glen iris</a><a id="link_text-260-12" class